{"Title":"An Act designating certain employees of the Massachusetts Department of Transportation to be in Group 2 of the contributory retirement system","BillNumber":"H2470","DocketNumber":"HD2032","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:37:07.687"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:37:07.6866667"},{"Id":null,"Name":"David Holway","Type":3,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:37:07.6866667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2470/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Chan of Quincy, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2470) of Tackey Chan and David Holway relative to placing certain employees of the Department of Transportation in Group 2 of the contributory retirement system for public employees.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 3 of Chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the words “Cushing Hospital”, in line 282, the following words:- “Highway and Street Construction and Maintenance Workers of the Massachusetts Department of Transportation.”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}